\pard\cf1\f1\fs30\b Before we begin\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\cf3\fs19\par
This wizard will install \cf1\b KNP Management System\b0\cf3  - the Windows desktop edition of the Kabete National Polytechnic campus app.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b What's included\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Notes Library\b0\cf3  - browse and search lesson materials with a built-in PDF reader.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Timetable and exams\b0\cf3  - weekly timetable, exam timetable and lesson reminders.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Grades and GPA\b0\cf3  - results, GPA tracker and academic progress.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Hostel bookings\b0\cf3  - view houses, cubes, availability and book a room.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Campus services\b0\cf3  - elections, payments, messaging and notifications.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab\cf1\b Official tools\b0\cf3  - access control, QR attendance and management screens, based on your role.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b System requirements\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab Windows 10 or Windows 11, 64-bit.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab About 250 MB of free disk space.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab An internet connection for sign-in and syncing.\par
\pard\li280\fi-280\bullet\tab A Kabete Polytechnic account, or continue as a guest.\par
\pard\cf1\f1\fs22\b Please note\b0\f0\fs19\par
\pard\cf3 Push notifications, Google Maps and some mobile-only features are not available in the Windows edition. Your data stays in the school's Firebase project and is shared with the mobile app.\par
\pard\cf3\par
\pard\cf3 Click \b Next\b0  to continue.\par
